  <Strings>
    <Section>entry</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>790</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000088</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん、間違いない。
リブガロらしきバイラスが
目撃されたのは、この先だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sim, é aqui. Parece que viram
o Livgaro um pouco mais
adiante.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>835</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000089</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ、フランツさん、
リブガロってどんなヤツなの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, Frantz, que tipo de Birus
é o Livgaro?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>872</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00008a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さまざまなウワサがあるんだが、
共通しているのは、
一本角で金色の身体をしている
という事だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ouvi vários rumores, mas todos
concordam na aparência da criatura:
ela tem um único chifre e o corpo
dourado.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>901</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00008b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>金色の身体だって？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Corpo dourado?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>938</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00008c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見ればわかると、
目撃者全員が言ってるそうだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quem viu diz que é algo que
é preciso ver pra acreditar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>974</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00008d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>手がかりはそれか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então é só isso que temos
pra nos guiar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00008e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんとしても、
リブガロを見つけるんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vamos encontrar o Livgaro,
não importa o que aconteça.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00008f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Annie&gt;、待ってろよ!!
もう少しの辛抱だからな!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Annie&gt;, só aguente mais
um pouquinho!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000090</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フランツさん、
&lt;Annie&gt;を頼みます。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Frantz, por favor, cuide
de &lt;Annie&gt; por nós.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1109</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000091</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかった。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pode deixar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1591</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2a000037</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これが……世界……
とても……とても広い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isto... é o mundo.
É muito... vasto...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1738</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はぁ……はぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haah... Haah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1696</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000092</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この娘は小生に任せるんだ。
さあ、急いで！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu cuido dela.
Vocês precisam correr!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;休憩しますか？
　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Quer descansar?
Sim
Não</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
